          name: '~60',
          '~0': "Lint, test or type-check commands the Model API backend runs after each round of edits, before the model's next request; the model can also run them with run_checks, and Muse Code is told to run them itself. Each runs as the shell tool runs a command, your tool hooks included: it asks wherever a shell command would ask (Manual, Edit automatically and Auto, unless one of your command rules allows it), asks again after the agent edits a file that decides what it runs unless a command rule allows it, never runs in Plan mode or Restricted Mode, and stops at its time limit. After three failing rounds in a row they stop until your next message.",
